WEBVTT

00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:31.920
means sending and receiving
a lot of faxes.

00:00:33.147 --> 00:00:36.043
Voting is one of our most
fundamental rights.

00:00:36.431 --> 00:00:38.051
It's one of the most tangible ways

00:00:38.075 --> 00:00:41.097
that each and every one of us
can shape our communities.

00:00:41.506 --> 00:00:44.032
And as we enter this fourth
industrial revolution,

00:00:44.056 --> 00:00:46.942
where technology is changing
everything around us,

00:00:46.966 --> 00:00:51.361
you would think, with something
as important as the right to vote,

00:00:51.385 --> 00:00:54.638
that we would have
the most modern, secure,

00:00:54.662 --> 00:00:57.681
inclusive system that could exist ...

00:00:57.705 --> 00:00:58.855
But we don't.

00:00:59.645 --> 00:01:01.769
When we look at comparable democracies,